This repository also contains material from others, under these terms:

- code/serve/ch15/sherpa_server.py subclasses the streaming WebSocket server of k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx
  (python-api-examples/streaming_server.py at tag v2.0.1, Copyright Xiaomi Corp., Apache License 2.0) and
  contains modified copies of two of its methods (handle_connection, handle_connection_impl). The original files
  are not included; code/serve/ch15/fetch_vendor.sh downloads them.
- code/data/manifests/, code/serve/data/test_utts.jsonl and code/tts/textset/ contain transcripts of utterances
  from LibriSpeech (Panayotov et al., CC BY 4.0, openslr.org/12), LibriTTS-R (Koizumi et al., CC BY 4.0,
  openslr.org/141) and AISHELL-1 (Beijing Shell Shell Technology Co., Ltd., Apache License 2.0, openslr.org/33).
- code/tts/results/ch13_audio/ contains audio decoded from a LibriTTS-R recording (CC BY 4.0) by Vocos
  (charactr/vocos-mel-24khz, MIT) and by the Mimi codec (kyutai, CC BY 4.0).
- code/serve/ch18/qwen3_tts_cascade.yaml is a copy of vLLM-Omni's deploy/qwen3_tts.yaml (v0.32.0, Apache
  License 2.0), modified as described in its header. Some result files embed the text of that deploy file as
  `deploy_config_text`.
- Result files under code/**/results/ contain samples, features, text recognized from, transcripts of and audio
  statistics of the recordings above.
